        <section id="constructors-(methods)" >
          
            <h2>Constructors (Methods)</h2>
              <p>A Class Constructor is called to instantiate (i.e. create in memory) an object of its Class (‘blueprint’) type (e.g. Dog or Student).  Constructor methods therein also setup the initial state of the instantiated object (i.e. the starting values for name, gender, birthday etc).  Constructors have the same name as their class.</p>

              
              <div class="c-code"><pre class="language-java"><code class="language-java"><span class="highlight-line"><span class="token keyword">public</span> <span class="token keyword">class</span> <span class="token class-name">Dog</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span></span><br><span class="highlight-line"><span class="token comment">// Private attributes can only be accessed via the class</span></span><br><span class="highlight-line"><span class="token comment">// and cannot be modified outside the class.</span></span><br><span class="highlight-line"><span class="token comment">// All related constructors, getters and setters are all</span></span><br><span class="highlight-line"><span class="token comment">// public to allow for changes to these attributes when</span></span><br><span class="highlight-line"><span class="token comment">// the object is built.</span></span><br><span class="highlight-line"></span><br><span class="highlight-line"><span class="token keyword">private</span> <span class="token class-name">String</span> name<span class="token punctuation">;</span></span><br><span class="highlight-line">    <span class="token keyword">private</span> <span class="token class-name">String</span> breed<span class="token punctuation">;</span></span><br><span class="highlight-line">    <span class="token keyword">private</span> <span class="token keyword">int</span> age<span class="token punctuation">;</span></span><br><span class="highlight-line"><span class="token punctuation">}</span></span></code></pre>
</div>

            
          
        </section>
        
    
     
    
  
     
    
  
  
        <section id="types-of-constructors"  class="t-bg-supporting3">
          
            <h2>Types of Constructors</h2>
              <p>A <em>Parameterised Constructor</em> contains parameters (possibly from user input) that are used to set the initial state of an object's attributes upon instantiation (i.e. creation in memory).</p>
<p>A <em>Default Constructor</em> does not contain any parameters and provides the default values to all object attributes depending on each attributes datatype, e.g int = 0, String = null etc.</p>

              
              <div class="c-code"><pre class="language-java"><code class="language-java"><span class="highlight-line"><span class="token comment">// This constructor is passing in the attributes from information</span></span><br><span class="highlight-line"><span class="token comment">// declared when the object is created. This is known as a</span></span><br><span class="highlight-line"><span class="token comment">// parameterised constructor</span></span><br><span class="highlight-line"></span><br><span class="highlight-line"><span class="token keyword">public</span> <span class="token class-name">Dog</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token class-name">String</span> name<span class="token punctuation">,</span> <span class="token class-name">String</span> breed<span class="token punctuation">,</span> <span class="token keyword">int</span> age<span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span></span><br><span class="highlight-line"><span class="token keyword">this</span><span class="token punctuation">.</span>name <span class="token operator">=</span> name<span class="token punctuation">;</span></span><br><span class="highlight-line">    <span class="token keyword">this</span><span class="token punctuation">.</span>breed <span class="token operator">=</span> breed<span class="token punctuation">;</span></span><br><span class="highlight-line">    <span class="token keyword">this</span><span class="token punctuation">.</span>age <span class="token operator">=</span> age<span class="token punctuation">;</span></span><br><span class="highlight-line"><span class="token punctuation">}</span></span><br><span class="highlight-line"></span><br><span class="highlight-line"><span class="token comment">// When no data is passed when the object is created the constructor</span></span><br><span class="highlight-line"><span class="token comment">// is called a default constructor and is normally empty.  These types</span></span><br><span class="highlight-line"><span class="token comment">// of constructors are only useful if there is a setter for all the attributes.</span></span><br><span class="highlight-line"></span><br><span class="highlight-line"><span class="token keyword">public</span> <span class="token class-name">Dog</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">{</span></span><br><span class="highlight-line">name <span class="token operator">=</span> <span class="token string">""</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span></span><br><span class="highlight-line">breed <span class="token operator">=</span> <span class="token string">""</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span></span><br><span class="highlight-line">age <span class="token operator">=</span> <span class="token number">0</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span></span><br><span class="highlight-line"><span class="token punctuation">}</span></span></code></pre>
</div>

            
          
        </section>
        
    
     
    
  
     
    
  
  
        <section id="get-and-set-methods" >
          
            <h2>Get and Set Methods</h2>
              <h3>Getters and Setters</h3>
<p>The Get method returns the current value of its associated attribute from a specified object.</p>
<p>The Set method allows an attribute of a specified object to be changed at run time (thus changing the State of the object).  This also allows values passed in to be validated prior to setting the attribute (e.g. age &gt;= 0).</p>

              
              <div class="c-code"><pre class="language-java"><code class="language-java"><span class="highlight-line"><span class="token comment">// Getter, allows the software to get the name of an object</span></span><br><span class="highlight-line"><span class="token comment">// because it is public it is accessible outside the class</span></span><br><span class="highlight-line"></span><br><span class="highlight-line"><span class="token keyword">public</span> <span class="token class-name">String</span> <span class="token function">getName</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span></span><br><span class="highlight-line"><span class="token keyword">return</span> name<span class="token punctuation">;</span></span><br><span class="highlight-line"><span class="token punctuation">}</span></span><br><span class="highlight-line"></span><br><span class="highlight-line"><span class="token comment">// This setter allows the software to change the name of an object</span></span><br><span class="highlight-line"><span class="token comment">// if you do not wish the software to alter the name don't add a setter</span></span><br><span class="highlight-line"></span><br><span class="highlight-line"><span class="token keyword">public</span> <span class="token keyword">void</span> <span class="token function">setName</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token class-name">String</span> name<span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span></span><br><span class="highlight-line"><span class="token keyword">this</span><span class="token punctuation">.</span>name <span class="token operator">=</span> name<span class="token punctuation">;</span></span><br><span class="highlight-line"><span class="token punctuation">}</span></span><br><span class="highlight-line"></span><br><span class="highlight-line"><span class="token keyword">public</span> <span class="token class-name">String</span> <span class="token function">getBreed</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span></span><br><span class="highlight-line"><span class="token keyword">return</span> breed<span class="token punctuation">;</span></span><br><span class="highlight-line"><span class="token punctuation">}</span></span><br><span class="highlight-line"></span><br><span class="highlight-line"><span class="token keyword">public</span> <span class="token keyword">void</span> <span class="token function">setBreed</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token class-name">String</span> breed<span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span></span><br><span class="highlight-line"><span class="token keyword">this</span><span class="token punctuation">.</span>breed <span class="token operator">=</span> breed<span class="token punctuation">;</span></span><br><span class="highlight-line"><span class="token punctuation">}</span></span><br><span class="highlight-line"></span><br><span class="highlight-line"><span class="token keyword">public</span> <span class="token class-name">String</span> <span class="token function">getAge</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span></span><br><span class="highlight-line"><span class="token keyword">return</span> <span class="token punctuation">(</span>age <span class="token operator">+</span> <span class="token string">" years old!"</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span></span><br><span class="highlight-line"><span class="token punctuation">}</span></span><br><span class="highlight-line"></span><br><span class="highlight-line"><span class="token keyword">public</span> <span class="token keyword">void</span> <span class="token function">setAge</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token keyword">int</span> age<span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span></span><br><span class="highlight-line"><span class="token keyword">this</span><span class="token punctuation">.</span>age <span class="token operator">=</span> age<span class="token punctuation">;</span></span><br><span class="highlight-line"><span class="token punctuation">}</span></span></code></pre>
</div>

            
              <p>Important: Allows object attributes to be set as private, thus protecting these attributes, by controlling access through their Get and Set methods, to retrieve and amend an attributes value.</p>

          
        </section>
        
    
     
    
  
     
    
  
  
        <section id="behavioural-methods" >
          
            <h2>Behavioural Methods</h2>
              <p>A Behavioural Method contains behaviour functionality.  A Class can contain many Behavioural Methods.  These methods change the state of an object at run time (e.g. increasing a Person’s age attribute on their birthday).</p>

              
              <div class="c-code"><pre class="language-java"><code class="language-java"><span class="highlight-line"><span class="token comment">// Examples of class methods.</span></span><br><span class="highlight-line"></span><br><span class="highlight-line"><span class="token keyword">public</span> <span class="token keyword">void</span> <span class="token function">gettingOlder</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">{</span></span><br><span class="highlight-line">age<span class="token operator">++</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span></span><br><span class="highlight-line"><span class="token punctuation">}</span></span><br><span class="highlight-line"></span><br><span class="highlight-line"><span class="token keyword">public</span> <span class="token keyword">void</span> <span class="token function">eat</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">{</span></span><br><span class="highlight-line">    <span class="token class-name">System</span><span class="token punctuation">.</span>out<span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">println</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token string">"Nom nom nom!"</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span></span><br><span class="highlight-line"><span class="token punctuation">}</span></span><br><span class="highlight-line"></span><br><span class="highlight-line"><span class="token keyword">public</span> <span class="token keyword">void</span> <span class="token function">sleep</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">{</span></span><br><span class="highlight-line">    <span class="token class-name">System</span><span class="token punctuation">.</span>out<span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">println</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token string">"Zzzzzzzzzzzz!"</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span></span><br><span class="highlight-line"><span class="token punctuation">}</span></span></code></pre>
</div>

            
          
        </section>
        
    
     
    
  
     
    
  
  
        <section id="calling-the-class" >
          
            <h2>Calling the class</h2>
              <p>Here’s a class calling the Dog class and creating an object called myDog.</p>

              
              <div class="c-code"><pre class="language-java"><code class="language-java"><span class="highlight-line"><span class="token keyword">public</span> <span class="token keyword">class</span> createDog <span class="token punctuation">{</span></span><br><span class="highlight-line"></span><br><span class="highlight-line">  <span class="token keyword">public</span> <span class="token keyword">static</span> <span class="token keyword">void</span> <span class="token function">main</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token class-name">String</span><span class="token punctuation">[</span><span class="token punctuation">]</span> args<span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span></span><br><span class="highlight-line">      <span class="token comment">// Creating a dog from the dog class called myDog. This is created using </span></span><br><span class="highlight-line">      <span class="token comment">// the parameterised constructor.</span></span><br><span class="highlight-line"></span><br><span class="highlight-line">      <span class="token class-name">Dog</span> myDog <span class="token operator">=</span> <span class="token keyword">new</span> <span class="token class-name">Dog</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token string">"Fred"</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span><span class="token string">"Jack Russell"</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span><span class="token number">5</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span></span><br><span class="highlight-line">      </span><br><span class="highlight-line"></span><br><span class="highlight-line">      <span class="token comment">// Using the getter getName to display the name of the dog</span></span><br><span class="highlight-line"></span><br><span class="highlight-line">      <span class="token class-name">System</span><span class="token punctuation">.</span>out<span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">println</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>myDog<span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">getName</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token operator">+</span> <span class="token string">" is "</span> <span class="token operator">+</span> myDog<span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">getAge</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span></span><br><span class="highlight-line"></span><br><span class="highlight-line">      </span><br><span class="highlight-line">      <span class="token comment">// Calling a method from the Dog class called gettingOlder</span></span><br><span class="highlight-line"></span><br><span class="highlight-line">      myDog<span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">gettingOlder</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span></span><br><span class="highlight-line">      </span><br><span class="highlight-line">      </span><br><span class="highlight-line">      <span class="token comment">// Demonstrating the impact of running the gettingOlder method on the dog</span></span><br><span class="highlight-line"></span><br><span class="highlight-line">      <span class="token class-name">System</span><span class="token punctuation">.</span>out<span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">println</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>myDog<span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">getName</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token operator">+</span> <span class="token string">" is now "</span> <span class="token operator">+</span> myDog<span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">getAge</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span></span><br><span class="highlight-line">      </span><br><span class="highlight-line">      <span class="token comment">// Calling the method from the Dog class called sleep().  Note how all</span></span><br><span class="highlight-line">      <span class="token comment">// method calls from another class must use the object, which in this case</span></span><br><span class="highlight-line">      <span class="token comment">// is myDog, which we created above.</span></span><br><span class="highlight-line">      </span><br><span class="highlight-line">      myDog<span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">sleep</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span></span><br><span class="highlight-line">  <span class="token punctuation">}</span></span><br><span class="highlight-line"><span class="token punctuation">}</span></span></code></pre>
</div>

            
          
        </section>
        
    
     
    
  
     
    
  
  
        <section id="result" >
          
            <h2>Result</h2>
              
              <div class="c-code"><pre class="language-text"><code class="language-text"><span class="highlight-line">Running the above:</span><br><span class="highlight-line">Fred is 5 years old!</span><br><span class="highlight-line">Fred is now 6 years old!</span><br><span class="highlight-line">Zzzzzzzzzzzz!</span></code></pre>
</div>

            
          
